{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（21日）傍晚6時許，警方接獲職員報案，指於田灣海旁道7號興偉中心3樓辦公室拆信時，發現裝有粉末的可疑信件。</p><p>警方爆炸品處理課（EOD）正在場處理及調查。</p><p>據了解，興偉中心3樓全層均為大公文匯及點新聞辦公室。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T11:40:34.900316+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:09:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:17:52.963676+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:37:40.197711+00:00","content_hash":"7ceabbb58039b9efd874c1bac0f7b070bce26532dd2030fa79acb91d41c312a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}